{"text": "3. Multiply 8 × 6 = 48.", "start": 1335, "end": 1358, "label": "request"}
{"text": "We still need to find a combination. Let's try:", "start": 1360, "end": 1407, "label": "suggest"}
{"text": "9 + 8 + 5 - (8/8)", "start": 1409, "end": 1426, "label": "inform"}
