{"text": "2. Subtract 1 from the sum 9 + 8 + 5 = 22 - 1 = 21.", "start": 1478, "end": 1529, "label": "request"}
{"text": "We are off by 3:", "start": 1531, "end": 1547, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "9 + 8 + 5 - ((8/3))", "start": 1549, "end": 1568, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Let's try:", "start": 1570, "end": 1580, "label": "suggest"}
