{"text": "3. Multiply 8 × 7.375 = 59.", "start": 1708, "end": 1735, "label": "request"}
{"text": "Continuing around and adjusting:", "start": 1737, "end": 1769, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "We actually have a classic solution which works:", "start": 1771, "end": 1819, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "5 × 8 + ((9/8))", "start": 1821, "end": 1836, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Breaking it down:", "start": 1838, "end": 1855, "label": "suggest"}
{"text": "1. Compute (9/8) = 1.125.", "start": 1857, "end": 1882, "label": "request"}
